tors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761520, "segment_id": "4JjDmmJWrx", "segment_broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "segment_title": "Iraq / Prisoner Abuse / England Case", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Report introduced. \n (Ft. Bragg, North Carolina: Steve Osunsami)  The court appearance by Pvt. Lynndie England&#134; about prisoner abuse at Abu Ghraib prison in Iraq featured; scenes & photos shown; details given about the charges against her; courtroom sketches by Pat Lopez shown while today's testimony is recounted.  [England's attorney Rick HERNANDEZ&#134;- talks about England's case.]  [National Inst. of Military Justice president Eugene FIDELL&#134;- outlines how orders have to be handled in the case.] \n (Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Tonight's \"Nightline\" story on prisoner abuse in Iraq noted.", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63240.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761522, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761520, "segment_id": "n3zVJdawEf", "segment_broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "segment_title": "Terrorism / Al Qaeda Threat / Financial Institutions", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  Report introduced.   (Washington: Pierre Thomas)  Critical new information of Al Qaeda surveillance of financial institutions in New York City & Washington, DC, reviewed; details given about additional targets beyond the first five institutions.  [Secretary of Homeland Security Tom RIDGE&nbsp- comments on people sympathetic to the cause.]  [Former FBI agent Jack CLOONAN&#134;- outlines information being looked for.]  [San Francisco Mayor Gavin NEWSOM&#134;, Washington police department Chief Charles RAMSEY&#134;- comment on the alert status.]   (Studio: Elizabeth Vargas; White House: Kate Snow)  The anatomy of alert & the question of the politics behind the revelations of the terrorism intelligence discussed.", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63380.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761523, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761520, "segment_id": "wb0NAlNkct", "segment_broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "segment_title": "Iraq / Attacks", "segment_description": "(Studio: Elizabeth Vargas)  The death of two US soldiers from a roadside bomb in Baghdad, the death of two Marines during a security operation & the explosion of a car bomb in Baquba reported.", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63580.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761524, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "omNXuLCarR", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broa